        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 3.68,
        "out": 7.04
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_2",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg03",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "But I'd been hiding something, something I couldn't let her see",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 7.04,
        "out": 10.26
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_3",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg04",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "So I said the only words that kept her far away from me",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 10.26,
        "out": 13.68
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_4",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg05",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "\"I'm just tired, jaan… it's been a long day\"",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 13.68,
        "out": 20.06
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_5",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg06",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Ten-forty on the clock, she smiled, and then she said \"okay\"",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 20.06,
        "out": 23.6
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_6",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg07",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "But that \"okay\" was hiding a question she would carry every day",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 23.6,
        "out": 27.14
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_7",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg08",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "She switched off the lamp and turned the other way",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 27.14,
        "out": 29.98
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_8",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg09",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "And I lay beside the woman I have loved for twenty-four years",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 29.98,
        "out": 33.96
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_9",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg10",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Two feet away, listening to a sound I still can hear",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 33.96,
        "out": 37.02
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_10",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg11",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Her pretending to be sleeping, so I wouldn't see her tears",
