        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 44.84,
        "out": 49.06
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_13",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg14",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "And every night by ten-fifteen, I was \"too tired\" once more",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 49.06,
        "out": 52.28
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_14",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg15",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Sat out my nephew's wedding while she danced and looked at my chair",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 52.28,
        "out": 55.88
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_15",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg16",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "And I couldn't tell her why I wasn't standing there",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 55.88,
        "out": 58.7
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_16",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg17",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Then at 2 AM I'd slip out of our bed and shut the door",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 58.7,
        "out": 61.9
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_17",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg18",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Out on the balcony, my phone glowing… and she saw",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 61.9,
        "out": 64.94
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_18",
          "fit": "trim"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg19",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "I'm just tired, jaan…",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 64.94,
        "out": 71.56
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_19",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg20",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "Same three words every night, under the bedroom light",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 71.56,
        "out": 77.96
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_20",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg21",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "I'm just tired, jaan…",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 77.96,
        "out": 82.54
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "clip": "clip_21",
          "fit": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "transitionIn": {
        "type": "cut"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seg22",
      "role": "body",
      "line": "But I'm tired… of lying 'bout why",
      "vo": {
        "file": "vo.mp3",
        "in": 82.54,
